 MAVEN :                      Build automation        &        Project Management 
                                  |                                     |
            It helps Complie & Package JAVA Project                It helps in dependencies Management 

why Maven ?

   Usually used for the JAVA projects, we need upto date version of External dependencies 

HEART OF MAVEN :  pom file

  Maven will automatically download the new dependies, paths, everything will be take care by maven itself , known as Project Management tool

  Maven is used to 
                    RUN test
                     Create JAR / WAR file
                     Using plugin can check security vunerability

Download URL :  maven.apache2.org
               bin-> mvn [ env -> env -> system variable -> new MAVEN HOME -> path paste
                         path -> new -> paste path
  check
    CMD: mvn --version
---------------------------------------
              structure:
---------------------------------------
   
   application
   |
   |-pom                 # project object Model
   |-SRC
       |-main 
       |      |-JAVA           # JAVA Source Code
       |      |-resource       # Config file
       |      |-webapps        # webapps
       |
       |-test
            |-JAVA             # Unit Test'S
            |-resource
            |-NIT
            
-------------------------------------------------      

  Local Repo:    Stored on your computer
Central Repo:  default Global repo
 remote Repo:   own created repo for organaization [ prvt repo ]

CENTRAL REPO

Command:  mvn archetype:generate "-Dfilter=org.apache.maven.archetypes:"

maven Cordinate [ GAV ]
   group ID:        domain name.mavne [   ex: abc.com but enter as com.abc.maven ]
Artifact ID:
    Version:         default
    Package:         default

----NOW ARTIFACT CLONED AND MAVEN PROJECT CREATED-----

WHAT WE HAVE POM file ?

             properties
Dependencies Management
                  Build        [ plugin we have to execute specific ]   
 
  # Each phase of project actually execute by maven's Own plugin
  # Add fuctionality to project  # maven Compiler plugin       - java
                                 # surefire plugin             - RUN unit test
                                 # maven-jar-plugin            - package jar file


COMMAND's :
              mvn compile
              mvn test
              mvn clean
              mvn package
              mvn install
---------------------------------------


1. MVN COMPILE:   compil#e mvn project
                     here target file get's created, which have  

                                            Target
                                                  |
                                                  |- classes 
                                                  |         |-app.class
                                                  |         
                                                  |-generated-source
                                                  |-maven-stables
 2. MVN TEST:   
          |-surefire-reports
                           |-Test File ------ { can see the file here }

3. MVN CLEAN:  
         will delete everything got above 

4. MVN PACKAGE:
         ---do gain mvn compile------
           here JAR file get created { inside target folder }

5. MVN INSTALL:
            ---do gain mvn clean & mvn compile------        # by this evrthing get'S cleaned
        Here the snapshot will get created in local repo 
      .M2 -> repo

sequence:
              mvn clean
              mvn Compile
              mvn Test
              mvn package
              mvn install






















     
